<title>LEBANON: Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 67 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 67 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lebanon issued on Thursday certificates of deposit dated May 23 to commercial banks worth 67 billion Lebanese pounds.</p>
<p>The bank sold 60-day certificates worth 50 billion pounds at 12.75 percent annual interest and 45-day CDs worth 17 billion pounds at 12 percent.</p>
<p>Last week the bank issued CDs totalling 83 billion pounds -- 60-day certificates worth 79 billion pounds and 45-day certificates worth four billion at the same interest rates.</p>
<p>$1 = 1,542.5 Lebanese pounds</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 345723 345740 602057</p>
</text>
